<title>USA: Eastern says ups credit facility.</title>
<headline>Eastern says ups credit facility.</headline>
<dateline>MT. LAUREL, N.J. 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eastern Environmental Services Inc said Tuesday it has amended its revolving credit facility and increased the borrowing capacity from $50 million to $100 million.</p>
<p>The company said the increased capacity will be used primarily to fund additional acquisitions and provide working capital.</p>
<p>The company said the Bank of Boston and the Bank of America jointly provide the facility, with the Bank of Boston acting as agent.  The credit facility was also extended to May 8, 2000.</p>
